    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "マーチタン！　誕生日おめでとう！",
            "enText": "Machitan! Happy birthday!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -2637486944187726637,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イクノディクタス",
            "enName": "Ikuno Dictus",
            "jpText": "おめでとうございます、タンホイザさん。\n誕生日を迎えて、抱負などはありますか？",
            "enText": "Happy birthday, Tannhauser. Do you have \nany goals for the year ahead?",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3801305426617618416,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "そうだねぇ、ひとつオトナになったわけだし、\r\nしっかりしたお姉さんを目指そうかな。",
            "enText": "Well, now that I'm one step closer to being \nan adult, I want to be more reliable!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 8579526260636337636,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "あっ！　しっかりっていえば、マチタン\n校門前の掃除当番なの忘れてたでしょ！",
            "enText": "Ah! Speaking of reliable, you forgot you're \nsupposed to clean in front of the school gate, \ndidn't you?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -4275458759870171808,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "はうっ！？　私が当番だったっけ！？",
            "enText": "Wha?! It was my turn?!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 1429498739637248984,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ツインターボ",
            "enName": "Twin Turbo",
            "jpText": "ターボがかわりにやっといてあげたよ！\r\n誕生日だしオマケね！",
            "enText": "Trusty Turbo covered for you! \nNo biggie, it's your birthday!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -8644803191742945697,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "うう、ターボありがとう……！",
            "enText": "Ooh, thanks Turbo…!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -4197075477050303931,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "イクノディクタス",
            "enName": "Ikuno Dictus",
            "jpText": "そういえば今朝、タンホイザさんの洗濯物が\n乾燥機の中に入りっぱなしでした。\n部屋まで運んでおきましたので。",
            "enText": "That reminds me. This morning, you left your \nlaundry in the dryer. I went ahead and carried\nit to your room.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -3790927594467016464,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネタンホイザ",
            "enName": "Matikanetannhauser",
            "jpText": "はうあ……しっかりしたお姉さんが\nものすごく遠い存在に感じる……。",
            "enText": "Oof… Guess I'm a long ways \nfrom being reliable…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 7670279759127802591,
            "blockIdx": 9
        }
    ],
    "humanTl": true,
    "modified": 1784224964
}